jfWmDgByRXbKsL1vvXOwOvjs_-rWGGTWdTfIPn\u003ds0"]]],[["濃郁・鹹蛋黃拉麵","鹹蛋黃沙沙顆粒於湯中綻開，醇厚鹹香層層堆疊。"],["$180.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8PiE4usZxk0-430wrMHAfAs-vymWx8KF7ZLOTG-wcQbZ-vM6PqPgpKmMQDsAn7mwgKYoiBkwGFV4zS7G\u003ds0"]]],[["蒜香・豚骨拉麵","慢熬乳化的濃厚豚骨湯頭，佐日本蒜粒特調醬料。"],["$175.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/hUS-zid-vgRA8NJJWnMCX_oOldnbetDhQYHUzPRztVS2oRiYE3FSBNk6NVsavDGcHHTRsJglt3w-cxr3\u003ds0"]]],[["鰹香・醬油拉麵","鰹節高湯與熟成醬油調成獨門甘露，醇厚不鹹口。"],["$155.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/zv_jr-BxbJaRxhFncbooBhTl_J2Uhp30JKqI4DywuO_4n003f_PtRz63s9hHLznoo53iLJ39rBtKXeCY\u003ds0"]]],[["鮮魚・寶寶拉麵","為小小食客設計的溫柔一碗，淡口湯頭配軟嫩沙巴魚片。"],["$90.00"]]]]],[["乾麵",""],[[[["紅花椒・蔥香乾麵","紅花椒辛香遇上青蔥清爽，麻香跳動、餘味回甘。"],["$65.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/5ykZsgKeamGzRZrbss5qREdLPaBXRezZL_poKtwiRERo1VWcKUhr_BmFNA1QeumFRC8Vq26jgqiK4aV7\u003ds0"]]],[["豆香・澹澹冷麵","Q彈麵條浸入綿密豆香湯底，先柔後甘的沁涼冷麵。"],["$65.00"]]]]],[["飯類",""],[[[["唐揚雞・濃咖哩飯","酥脆日式唐揚雞淋上牛肉熬煮的濃郁咖哩醬。"],["$195.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/27t8NnXUTqra4_WEg1bxfRDGaN-DaYLsi2jf12UJ_nD34OK3t0rXoA1MVikLPaN-loh8_41tlKrTfLD5\u003ds0"]]],[["明太子叉燒飯","炙燒叉燒鋪上明太子，鹹香微甘、油脂香氣四溢。"],["$65.00"]]]]],[["鮮美海味、豐富炸物",""],[[[["金線炸蝦（2隻）","髮絲酥皮裹著飽滿鮮蝦，咬下卡滋作響。金黃酥脆與蝦肉甘甜同時綻放，是視覺與味覺的雙重驚喜。"],["$110.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/5UUeANaVOMsDEJ32O-S8tIW0VsjeAf10AauzBqr7eBMt9jtfmhva6dyO57uyilFH1ExQVKmW327RNcHI\u003ds0"]]],[["金線炸蝦（1隻）","同上，單隻份量，淺嚐即享。"],["$65.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IZ_yuSy_gIawlMhFYsyHU0qVnqb7QBDXA-B0iAhuQs24VDaV1nI9aAKCqn9PP4FHuXm1OPqoag9_yu_0\u003ds0"]]],[["唐揚蟹","整隻軟殼蟹下鍋酥炸，連殼都能享受的香脆滋味，海味濃郁、人氣居高不下，是小酌時的最佳良伴。"],["$99.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YaEo6oyP-4tgoH4ri1EAynGZdFoOL-3osiB0CYE7k2FOeTNvr2VQInfrJ1CIY8cqpNNayZGxNm6nG54M\u003ds0"]]],[["炙燒明太子貝柱","生食級貝柱鋪上明太子，炙燒後香氣四溢。與貝柱的甘甜碰撞交融，極簡卻奢華的小品。"],["$80.00"],null,null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8onWtJO91UZuqtCSiatESuzcS78LdUA-